  "title": "Billonaire Made a Dark-Skinned Village Girl an International Model, But Then He Lost Everything",
  "description": "Mocked and rejected because of her exceptionally dark skin, Kukua Asante, a humble Ghanaian village girl, experiences a life-changing transformation when a wealthy billionaire, Eliot, discovers her hidden beauty and helps her become an international supermodel.<br><br>But when Eliot loses everything, their lives take an unexpected turn. Will Kukua abandon the man who changed her destiny, or will she stand by him when the world turns against him?<br><br>KUKUA ASANTE is a powerful and emotional African movie about true love, colourism, loyalty, gratitude, destiny and the beauty of embracing who you are.<br><br>Watch until the end, and remember to like, subscribe, share and tell us where you are watching from.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/kukuaasante\">#KukuaAsante</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/africanmovies\">#AfricanMovies</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ghanaianmovies\">#GhanaianMovies</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/truelove\">#TrueLove</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/africanbeauty\">#AfricanBeauty</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/ananseweboftales\">#AnanseWebOfTales</a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/emotionalstory\">#EmotionalStory</a>",
